{
	"name": "Size Up",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-red.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You know how to quickly size up threats. When you roll initiative, you can choose a creature within 30ft and roll a Perception or Insight check against a DC equal to the creature’s passive Deception check score. On a success, you learn the following information about that creature:</p><ul><li><p>Which of the creature’s ability scores is the lowest.</p></li><li><p>The damage range of the creature’s most powerful non-magical attack.</p></li><li><p>The creature’s CR relative to your own as one of the following results: much weaker (CR 3 lower than your level or more), weaker (CR lower than your level), equal, stronger (CR higher than your level), or much stronger (CR 3 higher than your level or more).</p></li></ul>",
